{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":18,"code":"JOB","name":"Job","testament":"OT"},"chapter":35,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"JOB 35:1"},"Elihu spake moreover, and said, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"JOB 35:2"},"Thinkest thou this to be right, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," thou saidst, My righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," more than God’s? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"JOB 35:3"},"For thou saidst, What advantage will it be unto thee? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and, "]},"What profit shall I have, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["if I be cleansed"]}," from my sin? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"JOB 35:4"},"I will answer thee, and thy companions with thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"JOB 35:5"},"Look unto the heavens, and see; and behold the clouds ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which "]},"are higher than thou. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"JOB 35:6"},"If thou sinnest, what doest thou against him? or ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["if"]}," thy transgressions be multiplied, what doest thou unto him? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"JOB 35:7"},"If thou be righteous, what givest thou him? or what receiveth he of thine hand? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"JOB 35:8"},"Thy wickedness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["may hurt"]}," a man as thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art;"]}," and thy righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["may profit"]}," the son of man. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"JOB 35:9"},"By reason of the multitude of oppressions they make ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["the oppressed "]},"to cry: they cry out by reason of the arm of the mighty. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"JOB 35:10"},"But none saith, Where ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," God my maker, who giveth songs in the night; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"JOB 35:11"},"Who teacheth us more than the beasts of the earth, and maketh us wiser than the fowls of heaven? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"JOB 35:12"},"There they cry, but none giveth answer, because of the pride of evil men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"JOB 35:13"},"Surely God will not hear vanity, neither will the Almighty regard it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"JOB 35:14"},"Although thou sayest thou shalt not see him, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["yet"]}," judgment ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," before him; therefore trust thou in him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"JOB 35:15"},"But now, because ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so,"]}," he hath visited in his anger; yet he knoweth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it"]}," not in great extremity: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"JOB 35:16"},"Therefore doth Job open his mouth in vain; he multiplieth words without knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 35:16"}]}]}
